WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.209
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:35.479 --> 01:36.039
Master,

3
01:36.039 --> 01:37.080
please calm down.

4
01:38.160 --> 01:38.960
This Siberian tiger,

5
01:38.960 --> 01:41.640
no, this Dong Beihu,

6
01:41.880 --> 01:43.960
is the son of Lawyer Xiao's current landlord.

7
01:43.960 --> 01:46.090
He helps bring in cases at her law firm.

8
01:46.280 --> 01:48.800
He has a rather quirky personality.

9
01:48.920 --> 01:49.759
Absurd.

10
01:50.640 --> 01:52.570
She wants to make a name for herself

11
01:52.600 --> 01:54.800
with a team like this?

12
01:55.920 --> 01:58.180
In the future, for these minor disputes,

13
01:58.479 --> 02:00.680
just hand them over to the team lawyers.

14
02:00.960 --> 02:03.490
Don't let them take up too much of your energy.

15
02:03.720 --> 02:04.800
Tell me, this Xiao Longnv,

16
02:04.800 --> 02:07.400
where did she gather this bunch of 'geniuses'?

17
02:07.720 --> 02:10.720
A living bean bun, all greasy.

18
02:11.120 --> 02:12.520
One following her around,

19
02:12.520 --> 02:14.050
a bouncing little pumpkin.

20
02:14.160 --> 02:15.480
And there's an even better one,

21
02:15.480 --> 02:18.160
acting like a hooligan and stealing rice crusts.

22
02:18.160 --> 02:19.800
Stop talking nonsense.

23
02:20.040 --> 02:22.700
You're the one chattering the most all day long.

24
02:23.320 --> 02:25.520
Just tell me if what I said is true or not.

25
02:25.600 --> 02:26.480
If Xiao Longnv got these guys

26
02:26.480 --> 02:28.360
from blind boxes,

27
02:29.040 --> 02:30.300
she's really unlucky.

28
02:30.800 --> 02:32.460
Speaking of being unlucky...

29
02:32.520 --> 02:33.780
Our leader is the best.

30
02:34.600 --> 02:35.320
Why?

31
02:35.760 --> 02:36.880
He brought you out.

32
02:39.160 --> 02:40.040
Annoying.

33
02:41.680 --> 02:44.240
Here, your favorite potato and bean stew.

34
02:44.240 --> 02:45.160
Thanks, Mom.

35
02:50.320 --> 02:52.040
How's Jiayi's matter going?

36
02:52.160 --> 02:54.760
Which lawyer from your firm did you introduce?

37
02:55.040 --> 02:57.040
Li Xin, Lawyer Li.

38
02:57.320 --> 02:58.600
He happens to be

39
02:58.600 --> 03:00.960
the legal advisor for Jiayi's airline.

40
03:00.960 --> 03:03.420
So he can handle this for Jiayi along the way.

41
03:03.760 --> 03:04.520
Li Xin.

42
03:05.520 --> 03:07.780
I think I've heard you mention that name.

43
03:08.680 --> 03:10.320
Is he the one who's really impressive?

44
03:10.320 --> 03:11.650
He's super impressive.

45
03:12.160 --> 03:14.680
He's the youngest senior partner at Honghu.

46
03:17.320 --> 03:18.520
Young and promising.

47
03:18.600 --> 03:20.400
You should learn from him.

48
03:22.320 --> 03:23.680
How can I learn from him?

49
03:23.960 --> 03:24.760
He's a lawyer.

50
03:24.760 --> 03:25.520
I'm in admin.

51
03:25.520 --> 03:26.980
We have nothing in common.

52
03:27.040 --> 03:28.240
You lack ambition.

53
03:28.960 --> 03:31.320
You're already on such a good platform.

54
03:31.320 --> 03:33.680
Why don't you think about moving up?

55
03:35.320 --> 03:37.120
Go take the bar exam.

56
03:37.480 --> 03:39.880
Once you pass, ask Lawyer Li to mentor you.

57
03:40.320 --> 03:41.840
Your dad's suggestion is good.

58
03:41.840 --> 03:43.640
I'll sign you up for a bar exam prep class.

59
03:43.640 --> 03:45.640
You two make it sound so easy.

60
03:45.760 --> 03:47.200
The bar exam is super hard.

61
03:47.200 --> 03:48.880
There's an intern at our law firm

62
03:48.880 --> 03:50.810
who hasn't passed it in five years.

63
03:52.160 --> 03:53.320
Even Honghu has interns

64
03:53.320 --> 03:55.600
who can't pass the bar exam?

65
03:59.160 --> 03:59.880
Of course.

66
04:00.560 --> 04:05.040
He's the nephew of the head of the marketing department.

67
04:05.320 --> 04:07.450
He got in purely through connections.

68
04:07.760 --> 04:08.880
It's a society of connections.

69
04:08.880 --> 04:11.160
See? You still have to rely on connections.

70
04:11.160 --> 04:12.000
Miaomiao,

71
04:12.040 --> 04:13.160
let me tell you.

72
04:13.320 --> 04:14.760
You need to be smart about things.

73
04:14.760 --> 04:17.480
You have to build a good relationship with your boss, you know?

74
04:17.480 --> 04:18.279
I know.

75
04:18.600 --> 04:19.480
Let's eat.

76
04:20.000 --> 04:20.640
Come eat.

77
04:30.480 --> 04:31.280
Ouch.

78
04:31.280 --> 04:32.360
Are you scrubbing a steel plate?

79
04:32.360 --> 04:33.159
Does it hurt?

80
04:33.159 --> 04:34.200
Of course it does.

81
04:38.480 --> 04:39.080
It hurts.

82
04:39.320 --> 04:40.850
Will you remember the pain?

83
04:41.040 --> 04:42.159
What are you doing? Are you lecturing me?

84
04:42.159 --> 04:43.920
Why are you so arrogant?

85
04:43.920 --> 04:44.920
I find you a bit...

86
04:45.720 --> 04:47.600
Uncle, I just joined the law firm.

87
04:48.159 --> 04:49.920
If you cause any more trouble,

88
04:50.320 --> 04:52.720
Director Xiao will get mad and kick me out.

89
04:52.920 --> 04:53.920
Kick you out?

90
04:54.040 --> 04:55.200
We are on the same level, you know?

91
04:55.200 --> 04:56.159
We are equals.

92
04:56.159 --> 04:57.200
Who's kicking who?

93
04:57.200 --> 04:58.320
Be humble.

94
04:58.720 --> 04:59.720
It hurts, Luo Zhi.

95
05:06.920 --> 05:07.760
It's about time.

96
05:07.760 --> 05:08.620
Get ready to go.

97
05:09.360 --> 05:11.000
If the reconciliation goes smoothly today,

98
05:11.000 --> 05:12.860
Jiayi will finally find closure.

99
05:13.360 --> 05:16.920
Remember, don't provoke her today.

100
05:17.040 --> 05:18.320
Make sure everything goes smoothly.

101
05:18.320 --> 05:19.250
Especially you.

102
05:19.320 --> 05:20.880
You just drive.

103
05:20.880 --> 05:22.040
Don't talk nonsense.

104
05:22.040 --> 05:24.000
Don't wander off, and don't mess up.

105
05:24.000 --> 05:25.000
Can you do that?

106
05:31.040 --> 05:31.880
Jiayi.

107
05:32.840 --> 05:33.760
Hello, Jiayi.

108
05:34.480 --> 05:36.140
We are on our way to pick you up.

109
05:36.200 --> 05:37.440
Sorry, Miaomiao.

110
05:38.159 --> 05:40.000
I'm really not feeling well.

111
05:40.000 --> 05:42.330
I might need to rest a bit before going out.

112
05:44.440 --> 05:45.760
It's okay, Jiayi.

113
05:45.880 --> 05:47.960
Take your time. Leave when you feel better.

114
05:47.960 --> 05:48.960
No rush.

115
05:49.320 --> 05:50.520
Thank you, Ms. Xiao.

116
05:50.760 --> 05:52.040
Sorry for the trouble.

117
05:56.320 --> 05:57.780
Alright, change of plans.

118
05:58.080 --> 05:59.600
I'll go to the airline first.

119
05:59.600 --> 06:00.800
You two go pick her up.

120
06:01.200 --> 06:02.960
Remember, don't agitate her.

121
06:02.960 --> 06:04.200
Be mindful of her feelings.

122
06:04.200 --> 06:05.060
Can you do that?

123
06:05.400 --> 06:06.080
Promise?

124
06:06.080 --> 06:06.760
Understood.

125
06:06.760 --> 06:07.400
Okay.

126
06:07.400 --> 06:09.720
Director, can I go with them?

127
06:11.960 --> 06:12.520
Okay.

128
06:15.200 --> 06:17.080
Why are you joining the fun?

129
06:17.320 --> 06:18.720
I'll go keep an eye on things for you.

130
06:18.720 --> 06:19.840
Keep an eye on what?

131
06:20.320 --> 06:21.200
On you.

132
06:21.200 --> 06:22.320
Are you crazy?

133
06:22.880 --> 06:24.010
Should be here soon.

134
06:25.960 --> 06:26.840
Hello, Attorney Xiao.

135
06:26.840 --> 06:27.200
Nice to meet you.

136
06:27.200 --> 06:28.040
Hello, Attorney Xiao.

137
06:28.040 --> 06:28.520
Hello.

138
06:28.880 --> 06:29.940
Please have a seat.

139
06:30.040 --> 06:31.200
Hello, Mr. Hu.

140
06:31.400 --> 06:33.840
I am Xu Jiayi's attorney, Xiao Longnv.

141
06:37.880 --> 06:38.640
Hello.

142
06:38.640 --> 06:40.400
I'm Mr. Hu's attorney.

143
06:40.400 --> 06:41.400
I'm Wu Yong.

144
06:41.400 --> 06:43.130
Hello, Mr. Wu. Nice to meet you.

145
06:44.640 --> 06:45.440
Are you alone?

146
06:45.640 --> 06:46.570
She didn't come?

147
06:46.640 --> 06:47.520
Doesn't she want me to apologize?

148
06:47.520 --> 06:48.080
She's coming.

149
06:48.080 --> 06:50.159
She felt a little unwell on the way.

150
06:50.159 --> 06:51.520
My colleague went to pick her up.

151
06:51.520 --> 06:52.760
In the meantime,

152
06:52.760 --> 06:54.159
I'd like to talk to Mr. Hu

153
06:54.159 --> 06:55.820
about her current condition.

154
06:56.040 --> 06:56.570
Go ahead.

155
06:59.840 --> 07:02.480
Jiayi, are you okay?

156
07:02.840 --> 07:03.840
Much better.

157
07:07.040 --> 07:08.840
I need to take a call. Wait for me.

158
07:09.520 --> 07:11.640
Hurry up.

159
07:14.080 --> 07:14.880
Hello, Mom.

160
07:14.880 --> 07:15.520
What's up?

161
07:15.720 --> 07:17.480
Miaomiao, what are you doing?

162
07:17.880 --> 07:19.520
I'm at work. What's wrong?

163
07:19.840 --> 07:20.770
That's perfect.

164
07:20.840 --> 07:23.700
Your dad and I are right downstairs at your law firm.

165
07:24.200 --> 07:26.400
What? You two came to Honghu?

166
07:26.400 --> 07:28.200
Miaomiao, come down right now.

167
07:28.520 --> 07:29.400
I'll tell you when you get down here.

168
07:29.400 --> 07:30.160
Okay.

169
07:30.160 --> 07:31.840
Stay right there and wait for me.

170
07:31.840 --> 07:33.520
I'm coming down right now.

171
07:38.080 --> 07:39.840
You've got some nerve.

172
07:40.520 --> 07:42.040
Does the director know about this?

173
07:42.040 --> 07:43.640
No, he doesn't.

174
07:44.200 --> 07:45.720
I don't have time to explain it to you two right now.

175
07:45.720 --> 07:46.880
Please keep it a secret for me, okay?

176
07:46.880 --> 07:47.840
I'm begging you.

177
07:47.840 --> 07:49.400
Then you owe us a big favor.

178
07:49.400 --> 07:50.880
Okay, bro. I'll owe you whatever.

179
07:50.880 --> 07:51.520
You two must

180
07:51.520 --> 07:53.640
get Jiayi safely to the airline.

181
07:54.000 --> 07:54.640
Thank you.

182
07:54.840 --> 07:56.300
Let me have a word with her.

183
07:56.520 --> 07:58.640
Little girl, you're two-faced.

184
07:59.640 --> 08:02.570
You can never keep secrets from your uncle, you know?

185
08:06.640 --> 08:07.840
They haven't arrived yet.

186
08:07.840 --> 08:09.520
I've wasted my whole morning here.

187
08:09.520 --> 08:11.520
They are on their way, Mr. Hu.

188
08:11.520 --> 08:12.640
It's mainly because Xu Jiayi

189
08:12.640 --> 08:14.200
hasn't been in a good state recently.

190
08:14.200 --> 08:16.400
Going out, meeting people,

191
08:16.400 --> 08:17.520
especially strangers,

192
08:17.520 --> 08:18.960
and taking public transportation,

193
08:18.960 --> 08:20.760
all put her under a lot of psychological pressure.

194
08:20.760 --> 08:22.520
Mr. Hu, please understand.

195
08:22.640 --> 08:24.200
Let's face the problem together

196
08:24.200 --> 08:25.460
and solve it together.

197
08:25.640 --> 08:27.840
Yes, let's stay calm.

198
08:28.080 --> 08:29.640
Mr. Hu, please bear with us.

199
08:29.720 --> 08:31.040
My time is also very precious.

200
08:31.040 --> 08:31.960
An hour of my time is not cheaper

201
08:31.960 --> 08:32.960
than these lawyers.

202
08:32.960 --> 08:33.280
Yes.

203
08:33.280 --> 08:35.200
Who will compensate me for delaying my business?

204
08:35.200 --> 08:36.080
Yes, yes.

205
08:55.400 --> 08:56.200
Uncle, uncle.

206
09:00.280 --> 09:01.480
Uncle, turn here.

207
09:01.480 --> 09:03.610
There's a shortcut here. Hurry, turn.

208
09:11.960 --> 09:13.160
Why hasn't he come down yet?

209
09:13.160 --> 09:15.640
Exactly. What is this kid doing?

210
09:15.880 --> 09:17.080
It's been so long.

211
09:33.600 --> 09:34.640
Do you know where she is?

212
09:34.640 --> 09:35.840
Mom, Dad.

213
09:38.080 --> 09:38.280
Miaomiao.

214
09:38.280 --> 09:38.880
What's wrong?

215
09:38.880 --> 09:39.400
Sweetie.

216
09:39.400 --> 09:40.640
What happened to you?

217
09:40.640 --> 09:41.760
You're sweating all over.

218
09:41.760 --> 09:42.820
You're all sweaty.

219
09:43.160 --> 09:45.040
I was rushing up and down delivering documents.

220
09:45.040 --> 09:45.720
What is it?

221
09:45.720 --> 09:47.720
Your mom and I were shopping nearby.

222
09:47.760 --> 09:49.960
So we bought some things to bring to you.

223
09:50.280 --> 09:51.080
Later.

224
09:51.080 --> 09:54.080
Take this up to Lawyer Li.

225
09:54.400 --> 09:55.640
Why give it to Lawyer Li?

226
09:55.640 --> 09:57.200
To build a good relationship.

227
09:57.200 --> 09:59.480
It's all about social etiquette, sweetie.

228
09:59.480 --> 10:01.040
You really are my own parents.

229
10:01.040 --> 10:03.170
Yes. Remember, you must give it to him.

230
10:05.440 --> 10:06.800
My colleague is looking for me. Hurry.

231
10:06.800 --> 10:07.440
Go back. Okay.

232
10:07.440 --> 10:08.120
We're leaving then.

233
10:08.120 --> 10:08.720
Go.

234
10:08.720 --> 10:10.000
Make sure you remember what I taught you.

235
10:10.000 --> 10:10.560
I know.

236
10:10.560 --> 10:11.080
Hurry.

237
10:15.080 --> 10:16.360
Uncle, no, that's not right.

238
10:16.360 --> 10:17.480
I think the navigation is wrong.

239
10:17.480 --> 10:18.720
What the hell? Look.

240
10:26.080 --> 10:27.200
How do you drive?

241
10:27.200 --> 10:28.480
You crashed into my new car.

242
10:28.480 --> 10:30.120
Sorry, bro. I have an emergency.

243
10:30.120 --> 10:31.200
How about this? I'll leave you my number.

244
10:31.200 --> 10:32.760
I'll contact you later, okay?

245
10:32.760 --> 10:34.000
What do you mean? Are you trying to run away?

246
10:34.000 --> 10:35.120
No, I'm really not.

247
10:35.120 --> 10:36.240
No, bro, listen to me. I'm getting out.

248
10:36.240 --> 10:36.920
Get out of the car.

249
10:36.920 --> 10:38.680
I know, I know. I'm getting out.

250
10:38.680 --> 10:39.560
Don't... Don't knock.

251
10:39.560 --> 10:40.680
Stop making noise.

252
10:40.680 --> 10:41.600
Don't hit it. It's fine.

253
10:41.600 --> 10:42.480
Jiayi, it's fine.

254
10:42.480 --> 10:42.960
Get out of the car.

255
10:42.960 --> 10:44.120
Stop hitting it.

256
10:44.360 --> 10:45.200
Get out.

257
10:45.240 --> 10:46.360
Get out of the car. Get out now.

258
10:46.360 --> 10:47.440
Get out. Get out.

259
10:47.440 --> 10:48.120
Stop knocking.

260
10:48.120 --> 10:49.600
Stop yelling. I'm getting out.

261
10:49.600 --> 10:50.860
I'm getting out, okay?

262
10:51.440 --> 10:52.200
I'm in a hurry to get to the hospital.

263
10:52.200 --> 10:53.360
Otherwise, I wouldn't be in such a rush.

264
10:53.360 --> 10:54.120
Jiayi.

265
10:54.760 --> 10:56.640
Uncle, Jiayi fainted.

266
10:56.840 --> 10:58.240
What did you do?

267
11:00.320 --> 11:01.600
Alright, I got it.

268
11:05.320 --> 11:06.320
I'm sorry, everyone.

269
11:06.320 --> 11:07.840
On her way here, Xu Jiayi

270
11:07.840 --> 11:09.320
had a stress reaction and fainted.

271
11:09.320 --> 11:10.240
She was sent to the hospital.

272
11:10.240 --> 11:11.720
She probably won't be able to make it today.

273
11:11.720 --> 11:12.780
Is it that serious?

274
11:12.840 --> 11:13.900
Are you kidding me?

275
11:13.960 --> 11:16.200
I spent the whole morning playing along with you.

276
11:16.200 --> 11:17.200
A stress reaction?

277
11:17.200 --> 11:19.080
Isn't that a disease for cats and dogs?

278
11:19.080 --> 11:19.840
I get it.

279
11:19.840 --> 11:21.720
You're playing the victim to get more money, right?

280
11:21.720 --> 11:23.320
Fine, name your price.

281
11:23.320 --> 11:24.080
No, Mr. Hu.

282
11:24.080 --> 11:26.080
Maybe I didn't make myself clear.

283
11:26.080 --> 11:26.960
She fainted.

284
11:26.960 --> 11:28.600
What does that have to do with me?

285
11:28.600 --> 11:29.360
Besides,

286
11:29.360 --> 11:31.200
I had a 40-degree fever at the time.

287
11:31.200 --> 11:32.240
Because of her,

288
11:32.240 --> 11:33.720
I didn't have time to take my fever medicine.

289
11:33.720 --> 11:35.840
The back of my head is still numb.

290
11:35.840 --> 11:36.720
How do we settle this?

291
11:36.720 --> 11:37.720
Who cares about me?

292
11:37.720 --> 11:39.440
Mr. Hu, please calm down.

293
11:39.720 --> 11:40.960
Didn't we agree on this?

294
11:40.960 --> 11:42.440
The airline will definitely compensate you.

295
11:42.440 --> 11:43.320
As for your compensation,

296
11:43.320 --> 11:44.360
I'll take it if I want it,

297
11:44.360 --> 11:45.840
and I won't if I don't.

298
11:45.840 --> 11:47.120
I'm doing you a favor by being here.

299
11:47.120 --> 11:48.320
Don't push your luck.

300
11:48.440 --> 11:49.200
No, no.

301
11:49.600 --> 11:50.120
Mr. Hu,

302
11:50.120 --> 11:52.200
we are here today to solve the problem,

303
11:52.200 --> 11:54.320
but the client couldn't come and went to the hospital.

304
11:54.320 --> 11:56.720
Let's reschedule for a time convenient for you.

305
11:56.720 --> 11:57.720
It's not convenient for me.

306
11:57.720 --> 11:58.720
I don't have time to play with you.

307
11:58.720 --> 11:59.320
I said,

308
11:59.320 --> 12:01.360
I came here because I don't want to argue with that bitch.

309
12:01.360 --> 12:02.840
Try insulting my client again.

310
12:02.840 --> 12:03.600
So what if I insulted her?

311
12:03.600 --> 12:04.560
I'll insult you too.

312
12:04.560 --> 12:05.440
Go ahead and insult me.

313
12:05.440 --> 12:05.970
Go ahead.

314
12:06.200 --> 12:06.840
Let me see

315
12:07.240 --> 12:08.320
what you're going to do.

316
12:08.320 --> 12:08.960
Calm down.

317
12:09.120 --> 12:10.160
What are you doing?

318
12:10.160 --> 12:11.080
Law of the People's Republic of China on Public Security Administration Punishments,

319
12:11.080 --> 12:11.840
Article 43:

320
12:11.840 --> 12:12.960
Beating another person

321
12:12.960 --> 12:14.840
or intentionally causing physical injury to another person

322
12:14.840 --> 12:16.080
shall be punished by administrative detention of not less than five days.

323
12:16.080 --> 12:18.080
Do you need me to start collecting evidence?

324
12:18.080 --> 12:18.840
Hu Sheng.

325
12:19.200 --> 12:21.320
Do you think we're begging for your apology?

326
12:21.320 --> 12:23.240
We suggested an out-of-court settlement to save time.

327
12:23.240 --> 12:25.320
You show no sincerity or respect.

328
12:25.480 --> 12:26.480
Fine. See you in court.

329
12:26.480 --> 12:27.440
Fine. See you in court.

330
12:27.440 --> 12:28.370
See you in court.

331
12:28.400 --> 12:28.840
Lawyer Xiao.

332
12:28.840 --> 12:29.720
See you in court.

333
12:29.720 --> 12:30.320
Lawyer Xiao.

334
12:30.320 --> 12:31.480
I am the victim.

335
12:31.480 --> 12:32.320
Lawyer Xiao.

336
12:32.840 --> 12:33.640
What the hell?

337
12:33.960 --> 12:34.600
Mr. Hu.

338
12:37.720 --> 12:38.520
He's just like this.

339
12:38.520 --> 12:39.850
He has this temper. I...

340
12:40.320 --> 12:41.980
I'll talk some sense into him.

341
12:45.720 --> 12:46.840
Didn't you say you'd deliver it safely?

342
12:46.840 --> 12:48.000
Why did you deliver it to the hospital?

343
12:48.000 --> 12:49.320
You promised and swore.

344
12:49.320 --> 12:50.320
Where did all that go?

345
12:50.320 --> 12:51.600
They call us an amateur troupe.

346
12:51.600 --> 12:53.130
And you really act like one.

347
12:53.960 --> 12:55.480
I... It's my fault.

348
12:55.480 --> 12:56.200
D-Director.

349
12:56.200 --> 12:57.600
Director, it's my fault.

350
12:57.800 --> 12:59.120
I messed up the navigation.

351
12:59.120 --> 13:00.600
It has nothing to do with them.

352
13:00.600 --> 13:02.200
I crashed the car. It's my fault.

353
13:02.200 --> 13:03.200
What's so good about it

354
13:03.200 --> 13:05.000
that you're all fighting for it?

355
13:05.320 --> 13:06.800
I'll settle the score with you when I get back.

356
13:06.800 --> 13:07.560
Where is Jiayi?

357
13:07.560 --> 13:08.600
She's inside.

358
13:08.600 --> 13:10.200
Are Xu Jiayi's family members here?

359
13:10.200 --> 13:12.000
Hello, I'm Jiayi's friend.

360
13:12.000 --> 13:14.200
Hello. You don't need to worry too much.

361
13:14.200 --> 13:15.930
Your friend had a panic attack.

362
13:16.000 --> 13:17.200
She is resting now,

363
13:17.440 --> 13:19.240
so just let her recover for a bit.

364
13:19.600 --> 13:21.320
The patient mentioned she has

365
13:21.320 --> 13:22.200
ASD (Acute Stress Disorder).

366
13:22.200 --> 13:22.720
Yes.

367
13:23.440 --> 13:25.720
Why is it so severe this time?

368
13:25.840 --> 13:27.080
The psychological burden was too heavy.

369
13:27.080 --> 13:29.560
Coupled with another external stimulus,

370
13:29.560 --> 13:32.200
it triggered a strong physical reaction.

371
13:32.600 --> 13:33.680
Although acute stress disorder

372
13:33.680 --> 13:34.600
is a

373
13:34.600 --> 13:37.000
relatively short-term psychological trauma,

374
13:37.000 --> 13:38.440
if not treated promptly

375
13:38.440 --> 13:40.000
and the stressors are not addressed,

376
13:40.000 --> 13:40.920
it is very likely

377
13:40.920 --> 13:43.080
to develop into a long-term psychological issue.

378
13:43.080 --> 13:43.560
Okay.

379
13:43.560 --> 13:44.360
Thank you.

380
13:44.360 --> 13:46.080
Alright. Can I go in and see her?

381
13:46.080 --> 13:46.940
Yes, come on in.

382
14:02.320 --> 14:04.320
If you were sent by the airline,

383
14:04.320 --> 14:05.920
save your breath.

384
14:06.440 --> 14:08.200
Look at the way you were looking at me.

385
14:08.200 --> 14:09.320
What was that about?

386
14:09.320 --> 14:11.200
The airline did ask me to talk to you about a settlement.

387
14:11.200 --> 14:12.320
I knew you wouldn't agree,

388
14:12.320 --> 14:13.480
so I refused.

389
14:14.080 --> 14:14.920
Really?

390
14:15.920 --> 14:17.050
That's more like it.

391
14:18.000 --> 14:18.530
Let's go.

392
14:18.560 --> 14:19.200
Let's go.

393
14:20.720 --> 14:22.200
How are you going to fight this?

394
14:22.200 --> 14:23.320
Two directions.

395
14:23.600 --> 14:24.720
The first one

396
14:25.200 --> 14:27.000
is based on tort liability.

397
14:27.600 --> 14:29.480
But in this direction, it's hard to prove

398
14:29.480 --> 14:30.360
that Hu Sheng's actions

399
14:30.360 --> 14:31.720
caused Xu Jiayi's injury

400
14:31.720 --> 14:32.720
and her illness.

401
14:32.960 --> 14:34.220
Let's take an example.

402
14:34.720 --> 14:36.960
A heart disease patient is pushed by someone,

403
14:36.960 --> 14:38.320
and right at that moment,

404
14:38.320 --> 14:39.960
he dies of a sudden heart attack.

405
14:39.960 --> 14:41.240
Can you say

406
14:41.480 --> 14:43.360
the person who pushed him is a murderer?

407
14:43.360 --> 14:44.080
No.

408
14:44.480 --> 14:46.000
Because I can't prove

409
14:46.120 --> 14:48.200
that the push caused the attack.

410
14:48.480 --> 14:50.240
So he only needs to bear

411
14:50.360 --> 14:52.220
the responsibility for the push.

412
14:52.480 --> 14:53.240
So,

413
14:53.360 --> 14:56.720
I'm going to fight it as a dispute over the right to life, health,

414
14:56.720 --> 14:58.720
and bodily integrity.

415
14:58.960 --> 15:00.960
From this angle, it's not that hard.

416
15:01.360 --> 15:01.960
As long as you prove

417
15:01.960 --> 15:03.720
that Xu Jiayi was indeed injured.

418
15:03.720 --> 15:05.240
But this second method,

419
15:05.240 --> 15:06.840
compared to the first one,

420
15:06.920 --> 15:09.480
offers less compensation and protection.

421
15:10.320 --> 15:11.000
I know.

422
15:11.800 --> 15:12.860
It doesn't matter.

423
15:13.000 --> 15:15.600
Xu Jiayi just wants his apology anyway.

424
15:16.320 --> 15:19.200
Also, the judge's subjective inclination is very important.

425
15:19.200 --> 15:21.080
People have habitual thinking.

426
15:21.320 --> 15:22.960
Not everyone can understand

427
15:23.480 --> 15:25.610
that a person's heart can also be hurt.

428
15:27.200 --> 15:28.200
What's going on?

429
15:29.360 --> 15:32.200
Why are you so enthusiastic this time?

430
15:32.360 --> 15:32.960
Am I?

431
15:33.360 --> 15:34.080
Yes.

432
15:34.200 --> 15:34.960
Really?

433
15:34.960 --> 15:35.680
Yes.

434
15:35.680 --> 15:36.480
What?

435
15:37.600 --> 15:41.260
You've been in the rain, so you want to hold an umbrella for others?

436
15:43.080 --> 15:43.840
Alright.

437
15:44.120 --> 15:44.840
I'm going back.

438
15:44.840 --> 15:46.440
Call me if you need anything.

439
15:50.480 --> 15:50.960
Dad,

440
15:50.960 --> 15:51.690
you're here.

441
15:52.920 --> 15:54.360
Dinner will be ready soon.

442
15:54.360 --> 15:55.360
I'll cook a fish.

443
16:58.560 --> 17:00.720
My client was isolated and helpless in the cabin.

444
17:00.720 --> 17:02.840
He just wanted to express his dissatisfaction with the service.

445
17:02.840 --> 17:03.720
How could his act of defending his rights

446
17:03.720 --> 17:05.079
be escalated by you

447
17:05.079 --> 17:06.480
to the level of infringement?

448
17:06.480 --> 17:08.960
There is a world of difference between defending rights and infringement.

449
17:08.960 --> 17:11.819
Defending rights should be a rational expression,

450
17:12.200 --> 17:13.720
rather than like the defendant,

451
17:13.720 --> 17:15.960
threatening others with violence.

452
17:16.240 --> 17:17.720
Just imagine,

453
17:17.839 --> 17:19.240
in a confined cabin,

454
17:19.560 --> 17:22.839
a woman being verbally threatened by a strange man

455
17:23.319 --> 17:24.920
and repeatedly subjected to

456
17:25.000 --> 17:27.960
his physical touch.

457
17:28.359 --> 17:31.020
Every second of confrontation in this scenario

458
17:31.080 --> 17:34.080
is a huge physical and mental strain on my client.

459
17:34.320 --> 17:35.680
If such behavior

460
17:35.800 --> 17:38.600
can be sugarcoated as a normal defense of rights,

461
17:38.840 --> 17:40.170
then I would like to ask,

462
17:40.680 --> 17:43.000
how can practitioners in the service industry

463
17:43.000 --> 17:44.960
work with peace of mind in the future?

464
17:44.960 --> 17:46.200
My client's behavior

465
17:46.200 --> 17:48.320
was just to bring the issue to the plaintiff's attention.

466
17:48.320 --> 17:50.720
Subjectively, he had no malicious intent to harm the plaintiff.

467
17:50.720 --> 17:52.600
Shouldn't harm be judged

468
17:52.720 --> 17:54.960
by the feelings of the victim?

469
17:55.440 --> 17:57.960
How can it be judged by the perpetrator's intentions?

470
17:57.960 --> 18:00.840
With just a few words and a few medical certificates,

471
18:00.840 --> 18:01.600
who can guarantee

472
18:01.600 --> 18:03.960
that the plaintiff is not exaggerating to win the case?

473
18:03.960 --> 18:06.600
Mental damage is not a subjective judgment.

474
18:06.600 --> 18:07.320
The Civil Code of the People's Republic of China

475
18:07.320 --> 18:08.720
explicitly includes it

476
18:08.720 --> 18:10.600
in the scope of personal rights protection.

477
18:10.600 --> 18:11.600
This is the law's rigid protection

478
18:11.600 --> 18:13.960
of human dignity.

479
18:14.480 --> 18:16.440
Neither party agrees to mediation.

480
18:16.440 --> 18:19.640
The verdict of this case will be announced at a later date.

481
18:33.120 --> 18:34.480
Is the verdict out?

482
18:34.880 --> 18:36.040
Let's see. Hurry.

483
18:37.680 --> 18:41.160
The defendant, Hu Sheng, during the plane's landing,

484
18:41.160 --> 18:43.240
had a conflict with the plaintiff, Xu Jiayi,

485
18:43.240 --> 18:45.480
and proceeded to tear the plaintiff's name tag,

486
18:45.480 --> 18:47.010
causing her clothes to rip.

487
18:48.000 --> 18:50.640
He shall apologize to the plaintiff according to the law.

488
18:50.640 --> 18:51.800
A public apology is a must.

489
18:51.800 --> 18:53.240
See? That's why Lawyer Xiao is awesome.

490
18:53.240 --> 18:53.560
Yeah.

491
18:53.560 --> 18:55.560
He wins every case he takes.

492
18:55.560 --> 18:56.200
Right?

493
18:58.560 --> 19:01.160
Why the long face? Still holding a grudge?

494
19:01.360 --> 19:02.480
Let me do a dance to calm you down.

495
19:02.480 --> 19:03.800
I just learned it today.

496
19:03.800 --> 19:06.720
Uncle, there's still a paragraph left unread.

497
19:06.960 --> 19:08.040
There's more?

498
19:08.200 --> 19:11.040
Because the plaintiff, Xu Jiayi, failed to provide evidence...

499
19:11.040 --> 19:14.640
Proving that she suffered mental distress due to this incident.

500
19:16.120 --> 19:17.040
The claims for lost wages and mental distress compensation under Paragraph 1 of Article 165,

501
19:17.040 --> 19:18.680
Articles 1110, 1003, 1004, and Paragraph 1 of Article 1117

502
19:18.680 --> 19:20.560
are denied.

503
19:20.720 --> 19:21.560
This means

504
19:21.800 --> 19:23.480
the court didn't acknowledge

505
19:23.480 --> 19:25.740
that Xu Jiayi suffered mental distress,

506
19:26.040 --> 19:28.880
nor do they believe her psychological trauma

507
19:28.880 --> 19:32.140
has a direct causal relationship with Hu Sheng's actions.

508
19:32.360 --> 19:34.160
If they don't acknowledge it, so be it.

509
19:34.160 --> 19:35.920
Let's not be too serious about it.

510
19:35.920 --> 19:37.280
Anyway, Xu Jiayi wanted an apology,

511
19:37.280 --> 19:38.280
and the court ordered it.

512
19:38.280 --> 19:39.240
So that's it.

513
19:39.240 --> 19:40.400
What do you mean that's it?

514
19:40.400 --> 19:41.560
What's wrong with being serious?

515
19:41.560 --> 19:43.280
The law is supposed to be serious.

516
19:43.280 --> 19:43.800
Besides,

517
19:43.800 --> 19:44.640
such a verdict

518
19:44.720 --> 19:47.040
is a secondary injury to Xu Jiayi.

519
19:47.280 --> 19:48.560
And that guy Hu Sheng,

520
19:48.560 --> 19:50.280
do you think he'll apologize sincerely?

521
19:50.280 --> 19:51.120
Can you?

522
19:56.680 --> 19:57.940
What's wrong, sister?

523
20:01.280 --> 20:04.340
Hu Sheng's lawyer said he is willing to pay 10,000 yuan.

524
20:04.680 --> 20:06.280
But he refuses to apologize.

525
20:06.280 --> 20:08.400
Does he think I only want money?

526
20:08.480 --> 20:10.410
I'm not doing this for money at all.

527
20:10.440 --> 20:11.800
It's okay, Jiayi.

528
20:12.040 --> 20:13.560
If you are not satisfied with this result,

529
20:13.560 --> 20:14.960
we will continue to appeal.

530
20:14.960 --> 20:15.800
Appeal?

531
20:16.040 --> 20:17.560
We will present new evidence,

532
20:17.560 --> 20:19.890
submit more detailed and clear evidence,

533
20:19.960 --> 20:21.760
and ask the court to reconsider.

534
20:21.800 --> 20:22.680
Of course.

535
20:22.960 --> 20:23.800
Then this case

536
20:23.800 --> 20:25.560
might drag on longer.

537
20:26.280 --> 20:28.560
You might also face more difficulties.

538
20:28.680 --> 20:30.800
So you need to think it through.

539
20:35.920 --> 20:38.450
I don't want to let it go unresolved like this.

540
20:40.720 --> 20:41.560
Lawyer Xiao,

541
20:43.200 --> 20:44.400
I trust you.

542
20:44.960 --> 20:45.960
I want to appeal.

543
20:47.880 --> 20:48.960
It's a scam.

544
20:49.760 --> 20:51.680
Two bitches are running a scam.

545
20:51.680 --> 20:52.800
They think it's not enough money.

546
20:52.800 --> 20:53.520
What do you call this?

547
20:53.520 --> 20:54.920
This is pushing their luck.

548
20:54.920 --> 20:56.720
This is being ungrateful.

549
20:59.040 --> 21:00.040
Calm down. I...

550
21:00.040 --> 21:00.970
Wanna play, huh?

551
21:01.280 --> 21:03.680
Fine. I'll play along to the end.

552
21:04.280 --> 21:06.200
Here's the plan. You write something.

553
21:06.200 --> 21:07.480
I'll post it online too.

554
21:07.480 --> 21:08.280
I refuse to believe

555
21:08.280 --> 21:09.960
I can't beat two little girls.

556
21:12.560 --> 21:14.960
One, two, three. Action.

557
21:18.200 --> 21:19.520
My name is Hu Sheng.

558
21:20.760 --> 21:24.560
I'm the person involved in the recent flight dispute.

559
21:25.520 --> 21:27.440
If I weren't forced to,

560
21:27.560 --> 21:30.760
I wouldn't have recorded this video and posted it online.

561
21:31.960 --> 21:32.760
See?

562
21:33.480 --> 21:34.720
The court ruled

563
21:35.280 --> 21:37.960
that this flight attendant's mental distress

564
21:38.200 --> 21:40.200
has nothing to do with me.

565
21:40.480 --> 21:41.960
But I never expected

566
21:42.160 --> 21:43.480
that she wouldn't let it go.

567
21:43.480 --> 21:45.200
She colluded with her lawyer

568
21:45.280 --> 21:46.960
and actually appealed against me.

569
21:46.960 --> 21:48.960
As a law-abiding citizen,

570
21:49.200 --> 21:51.440
I decided to sue this flight attendant

571
21:51.480 --> 21:54.200
and Star Alliance Airlines at the same time.

572
21:54.240 --> 21:55.240
This scumbag

573
21:55.240 --> 21:57.170
is treating himself as the victim.

574
21:57.480 --> 21:59.720
The comments are completely one-sided now.

575
21:59.720 --> 22:01.960
Netizens don't even distinguish right from wrong.

576
22:01.960 --> 22:03.960
This is purely the guilty party complaining first.

577
22:03.960 --> 22:05.680
If he feels wronged,

578
22:05.720 --> 22:07.280
it's actually not surprising.

579
22:07.280 --> 22:08.160
People

580
22:08.240 --> 22:10.800
always like to think from their own perspective.

581
22:10.800 --> 22:12.400
But no matter what he thinks,

582
22:12.800 --> 22:13.960
during the second trial,

583
22:13.960 --> 22:16.200
we must prove the harm he caused.

584
22:16.880 --> 22:18.480
And make him apologize publicly.

585
22:18.480 --> 22:20.400
Yes, he must apologize publicly.

586
22:20.760 --> 22:21.400
Right.

587
22:21.880 --> 22:23.080
This video by Hu Sheng

588
22:23.680 --> 22:25.640
has already had an extremely negative impact

589
22:25.640 --> 22:27.240
on the company's image.

590
22:28.200 --> 22:30.130
Our investment in brand promotion

591
22:30.440 --> 22:31.800
has all gone down the drain.

592
22:31.800 --> 22:33.200
We can't even handle

593
22:33.200 --> 22:34.680
the recent customer complaints.

594
22:34.680 --> 22:37.280
This kind of situation has never happened before.

595
22:37.280 --> 22:40.120
Why hasn't such a small matter been resolved yet?

596
22:40.200 --> 22:41.600
It's even getting worse.

597
22:41.880 --> 22:43.160
We invited Lawyer Li here today

598
22:43.160 --> 22:44.440
to solve this matter.

599
22:44.960 --> 22:45.960
Please rest assured, everyone.

600
22:45.960 --> 22:47.680
We will contact Hu Sheng as soon as possible

601
22:47.680 --> 22:49.120
and ask him to take down this video.

602
22:49.120 --> 22:51.050
Isn't it just a public opinion war?

603
22:51.200 --> 22:52.680
Let's fight him to the end.

604
22:52.720 --> 22:55.280
Issue an announcement, send a lawyer's letter,

605
22:55.280 --> 22:56.800
and sue him for defamation.

606
22:56.800 --> 22:58.960
Then find a few marketing accounts to hype it up.

607
22:58.960 --> 23:00.560
Public opinion is a variable,

608
23:00.560 --> 23:02.400
but the law is a constant.

609
23:02.480 --> 23:05.680
If we rely on inciting public opinion to influence the case,

610
23:05.680 --> 23:08.000
it will not only interfere with judicial justice

611
23:08.000 --> 23:09.240
but also backfire.

612
23:09.480 --> 23:10.240
Right.

613
23:10.440 --> 23:13.240
And I hope everyone understands one thing.

614
23:14.240 --> 23:15.960
What Xu Jiayi is suffering from now

615
23:15.960 --> 23:17.360
is psychological trauma.

616
23:17.360 --> 23:20.440
Public pressure is more likely to worsen it,

617
23:20.680 --> 23:21.480
perhaps becoming

618
23:21.480 --> 23:23.280
the last straw that crushes her,

619
23:23.360 --> 23:25.760
pushing things further out of control.

620
23:25.760 --> 23:27.960
There's no need to appeal.

621
23:28.720 --> 23:29.800
It's not a big deal.

622
23:29.960 --> 23:31.480
Why is she blowing it out of proportion

623
23:31.480 --> 23:32.680
and making such a fuss?

624
23:32.680 --> 23:35.200
This kid has indeed been wronged.

625
23:35.200 --> 23:37.040
I'll talk to her again.

626
23:37.680 --> 23:40.400
The important thing is to smooth things over.

627
23:40.720 --> 23:43.040
Understood. I'll handle it properly.

628
23:43.640 --> 23:44.720
None of these executives

629
23:44.720 --> 23:46.200
are truly considering Xu Jiayi's perspective.

630
23:46.200 --> 23:47.480
Thinking about the problem.

631
23:47.480 --> 23:48.480
That's for sure.

632
23:48.680 --> 23:49.480
For them,

633
23:49.480 --> 23:51.960
the most important thing is that their own interests are not damaged.

634
23:51.960 --> 23:53.680
They don't care about anyone else.

635
23:53.680 --> 23:55.720
You know, Hu Sheng is really interesting,

636
23:55.720 --> 23:57.200
even playing the public opinion card.

637
23:57.200 --> 23:59.440
Making endless fuss over such a small matter.

638
23:59.440 --> 24:00.160
Lawyer Su.

639
24:00.680 --> 24:02.680
I don't think this is a small matter.

640
24:03.000 --> 24:03.800
I didn't mean that.

641
24:03.800 --> 24:06.200
I definitely stand with Xu Jiayi on this.

642
24:06.200 --> 24:06.960
Bowen.

643
24:10.440 --> 24:11.200
Please prepare

644
24:11.200 --> 24:13.120
the detailed materials of Husheng Company for me.

645
24:13.120 --> 24:13.850
Understood.

646
24:17.240 --> 24:18.240
Jiayi,

647
24:18.440 --> 24:20.520
why don't you drop that lawsuit?

648
24:20.560 --> 24:21.760
Listen to Mom.

649
24:22.000 --> 24:24.360
It's not worth all this trouble

650
24:24.440 --> 24:25.720
over such a small matter.

651
24:25.720 --> 24:26.720
What if it blows up

652
24:26.840 --> 24:28.720
and affects your work?

653
24:28.800 --> 24:31.040
Is it really necessary to fight to the end over this?

654
24:31.040 --> 24:32.000
She's just asking for trouble.

655
24:32.000 --> 24:33.000
So stupid.

656
24:33.000 --> 24:34.280
I would have moved on long ago.

657
24:34.280 --> 24:35.200
I guess she's just a scammer.

658
24:35.200 --> 24:36.320
Didn't the court already make a ruling?

659
24:36.320 --> 24:36.920
Why is this still going on?

660
24:36.920 --> 24:38.920
It's a perfect match for Xingmeng to have such a flight attendant.

661
24:38.920 --> 24:40.400
This airline is usually so arrogant.

662
24:40.400 --> 24:41.600
Such a small matter, yet it's trending every day.

663
24:41.600 --> 24:43.240
What kind of entitled princess is this?

664
24:43.240 --> 24:44.160
It must be a publicity stunt.

665
24:44.160 --> 24:45.040
She's desperate for fame.

666
24:45.040 --> 24:46.720
She didn't expect to mess with the wrong person, did she?

667
24:46.720 --> 24:47.480
Is it really necessary

668
24:47.480 --> 24:49.080
to drag this out for so long?

669
25:30.680 --> 25:32.340
Are you feeling better today?

670
25:35.120 --> 25:36.380
About your situation,

671
25:36.840 --> 25:38.080
I've already spoken to the management.

672
25:38.080 --> 25:39.720
It wasn't your fault to begin with.

673
25:39.720 --> 25:41.120
In the service industry,

674
25:41.360 --> 25:44.420
our biggest fear is running into scoundrels like that.

675
25:44.600 --> 25:45.560
Thank you.

676
25:47.320 --> 25:48.280
You know what?

677
25:48.840 --> 25:51.320
I've actually always really liked you.

678
25:51.320 --> 25:52.800
You're young,

679
25:53.120 --> 25:54.160
but at work,

680
25:54.520 --> 25:55.960
you're hardworking, serious,

681
25:55.960 --> 25:58.220
responsible, patient, and persistent.

682
25:58.760 --> 26:00.560
I've told the management several times

683
26:00.560 --> 26:01.760
to promote you.

684
26:03.400 --> 26:04.240
Jiayi,

685
26:05.080 --> 26:06.880
getting to where we are now

686
26:07.280 --> 26:08.280
wasn't easy.

687
26:08.440 --> 26:11.900
There's no need to ruin your future over such trivial matters.

688
26:14.360 --> 26:15.160
Manager.

689
26:16.160 --> 26:18.890
Are you trying to persuade me to drop the lawsuit?

690
26:20.240 --> 26:21.040
This time,

691
26:22.160 --> 26:23.560
you were indeed wronged.

692
26:24.480 --> 26:26.810
But if this matter continues to escalate,

693
26:27.240 --> 26:29.200
the damage to the company's brand

694
26:29.200 --> 26:30.480
will be immeasurable.

695
26:32.720 --> 26:34.520
Let me tell you from the bottom of my heart.

696
26:34.520 --> 26:36.280
I also started as a flight attendant

697
26:36.280 --> 26:38.120
and worked my way up to this position.

698
26:38.120 --> 26:40.200
There's an old saying in our industry:

699
26:40.200 --> 26:43.560
Which flight attendant hasn't cried on a plane a few times?

700
26:47.200 --> 26:48.200
Wipe your tears.

701
26:49.280 --> 26:50.520
Let it go.

702
27:43.560 --> 27:44.440
Thank you.

703
27:53.440 --> 27:55.120
When I'm in a bad mood,

704
27:55.160 --> 27:57.440
I like to come here for a walk and relax.

705
28:03.320 --> 28:04.080
Have a seat.

706
28:08.720 --> 28:09.840
Ms. Xiao.

707
28:10.440 --> 28:12.880
People online are cursing me right now.

708
28:13.440 --> 28:16.240
The company also thinks I'm causing them trouble.

709
28:16.400 --> 28:18.200
Even my closest family members,

710
28:18.720 --> 28:20.180
they don't understand me.

711
28:22.320 --> 28:23.360
I don't know

712
28:23.840 --> 28:26.240
if I'm really too fragile, too dramatic,

713
28:26.240 --> 28:27.760
or just making a fuss over nothing.

714
28:27.760 --> 28:29.200
Of course you're not.

715
28:30.560 --> 28:31.760
You have to firmly believe

716
28:31.760 --> 28:34.480
that all your feelings are real.

717
28:35.320 --> 28:39.040
Just like this grass, these trees,

718
28:41.000 --> 28:42.120
and this breeze.

719
28:45.400 --> 28:46.200
Jiayi.

720
28:49.320 --> 28:51.200
You're actually really brave,

721
28:51.920 --> 28:53.520
braver than I expected.

722
28:54.200 --> 28:57.200
You dare to face your true emotions,

723
28:58.640 --> 29:00.560
and dare to fight for those little things

724
29:00.560 --> 29:03.320
that others say aren't worth mentioning.

725
29:07.120 --> 29:08.320
Thank you, Ms. Xiao.

726
29:09.880 --> 29:12.560
If it were you,

727
29:13.280 --> 29:14.540
what would you choose?

728
29:14.960 --> 29:15.760
Me?

729
29:18.520 --> 29:20.120
What would I choose?

730
29:22.240 --> 29:23.880
I always remember a saying.

731
29:24.120 --> 29:25.560
It roughly means,

732
29:25.800 --> 29:29.040
in the face of things that make you cry,

733
29:29.560 --> 29:31.960
you could have chosen to shout it out.

734
29:33.440 --> 29:36.280
Yes, then you should shout it out.

735
29:37.600 --> 29:39.560
As long as you bravely shout it out,

736
29:40.200 --> 29:41.000
I believe

737
29:41.960 --> 29:45.920
the world will definitely hear a little bit of that voice.

738
29:47.160 --> 29:48.440
And then maybe,

739
29:49.200 --> 29:51.130
someone will shout along with you.

740
29:54.000 --> 29:56.260
As long as there are more people shouting

741
29:56.480 --> 29:57.880
and fewer people crying,

742
29:58.840 --> 30:02.760
then those things that were originally impossible to change

743
30:03.680 --> 30:05.200
might just be changed.

744
30:07.960 --> 30:09.000
This case

745
30:09.760 --> 30:11.760
is facing quite a lot of resistance.

746
30:12.760 --> 30:13.560
So,

747
30:14.120 --> 30:16.850
I respect whatever choice and decision you make.

748
30:16.880 --> 30:18.040
Just do one thing.

749
30:19.120 --> 30:21.160
Listen to the voice in your heart.

750
30:21.840 --> 30:23.840
No matter what decision you make,

751
30:25.240 --> 30:27.160
I will firmly stand with you.

752
30:29.440 --> 30:30.720
Thank you, Ms. Xiao.

753
30:35.840 --> 30:37.040
I don't want to give up.

754
30:37.040 --> 30:38.320
Then let's not give up.

755
30:51.320 --> 30:53.320
The flight attendant hasn't dropped the lawsuit yet.

756
30:53.320 --> 30:54.120
Not yet.

757
30:55.800 --> 30:57.600
Then hire more internet trolls.

758
30:57.680 --> 30:58.360
I don't believe

759
30:58.360 --> 31:00.090
we can't beat two little girls.

760
31:00.840 --> 31:01.680
Come in.

761
31:01.760 --> 31:03.400
Mr. Hu, Lawyer Li Xin is here.

762
31:03.400 --> 31:04.760
He says he wants to talk to you.

763
31:04.760 --> 31:05.840
Tell him I'm not here.

764
31:05.840 --> 31:07.800
Mr. Hu, are you busy?

765
31:08.600 --> 31:09.360
Lawyer Li.

766
31:09.840 --> 31:10.840
Come in, come in.

767
31:10.840 --> 31:12.520
Mr. Hu and I are having a meeting.

768
31:12.520 --> 31:13.480
Please have a seat.

769
31:13.480 --> 31:14.480
I'm sorry, Mr. Hu.

770
31:14.480 --> 31:15.610
Sorry to bother you.

771
31:17.640 --> 31:20.280
If you're here on behalf of Star Alliance Airlines,

772
31:20.280 --> 31:21.400
I don't think we need to talk.

773
31:21.400 --> 31:22.200
You can leave.

774
31:22.800 --> 31:24.330
I won't take down the video.

775
31:24.680 --> 31:25.840
I want to defend my rights,

776
31:25.840 --> 31:26.840
and I will defend them to the end.

777
31:26.840 --> 31:29.600
Mr. Hu, I advise you not to be so certain.

778
31:30.680 --> 31:31.340
Who are you?

779
31:32.120 --> 31:33.780
What kind of attitude is that?

780
31:35.040 --> 31:36.520
I'm just looking out for you.

781
31:36.520 --> 31:38.240
I'm afraid you'll regret it later.

782
31:38.240 --> 31:39.560
What could I possibly regret?

783
31:39.560 --> 31:41.000
What... is this it?

784
31:41.080 --> 31:44.040
The cooperation we agreed on with Wangang has been suspended.

785
31:44.040 --> 31:45.170
Are they kidding me?

786
31:45.440 --> 31:47.720
They said it was their legal counsel's advice.

787
31:47.720 --> 31:50.160
They need to reassess the cooperation risks.

788
31:50.160 --> 31:52.420
Which bastard is the lawyer for Wangang?

789
31:52.720 --> 31:53.320
Mr. Hu.

790
31:55.560 --> 31:57.080
I am that bastard.

791
31:59.080 --> 31:59.720
Well...

792
31:59.720 --> 32:00.640
I've heard for a long time

793
32:00.640 --> 32:02.280
that Honghu is Wangang's legal counsel.

794
32:02.280 --> 32:03.280
So Lawyer Li is

795
32:03.280 --> 32:05.280
Wangang's chief legal counsel.

796
32:05.280 --> 32:07.240
I'm not here representing Xingmeng today.

797
32:07.240 --> 32:09.040
I'm here representing Wangang.

798
32:10.000 --> 32:11.360
Well, what would you two like to drink?

799
32:11.360 --> 32:12.280
I'll have someone bring it over right away.

800
32:12.280 --> 32:13.280
No need to bother.

801
32:13.400 --> 32:15.930
Lawyer Li has other things to attend to later.

802
32:16.600 --> 32:17.600
Okay, no problem.

803
32:18.320 --> 32:20.960
You're throwing your weight around here using someone else's name.

804
32:20.960 --> 32:24.400
I've been helping Wangang conduct due diligence on their partners recently,

805
32:24.400 --> 32:25.840
to eliminate legal risks,

806
32:25.840 --> 32:27.640
including reputational risks.

807
32:28.280 --> 32:30.840
It just so happens that your company, Mr. Hu, is within the scope of our due diligence,

808
32:30.840 --> 32:33.600
but the reputational risk ranks first.

809
32:34.880 --> 32:36.210
Are you threatening me?

810
32:36.760 --> 32:37.920
You're overstating it.

811
32:37.920 --> 32:40.650
Wangang Group has always valued its reputation.

812
32:41.120 --> 32:43.440
But your recent videos online

813
32:43.920 --> 32:45.440
have generated a lot of buzz.

814
32:45.440 --> 32:46.960
If you continue to hype them up,

815
32:46.960 --> 32:49.400
I'm afraid it will affect your cooperation with Wangang.

816
32:49.400 --> 32:51.200
I'm doing this for your own good.

817
33:02.160 --> 33:03.290
Please consider it.

818
33:11.640 --> 33:12.880
Lawyer Li, Lawyer Li, Lawyer Li.

819
33:12.880 --> 33:14.600
We're leaving, we're leaving.

820
33:14.600 --> 33:17.530
Mr. Hu was just driven crazy by the flight attendant.

821
33:17.880 --> 33:19.280
What time are we leaving?

822
33:22.720 --> 33:23.280
Six o'clock.

823
33:23.280 --> 33:23.800
Five o'clock.

824
33:23.800 --> 33:24.040
Five.

825
33:24.040 --> 33:26.240
Thank you for your cooperation, Mr. Hu.

826
33:26.400 --> 33:27.560
Forty-four minutes left.

827
33:27.560 --> 33:28.120
Okay.

828
33:29.040 --> 33:29.840
Forty-three.

829
33:31.800 --> 33:32.440
This...

830
33:47.760 --> 33:48.820
What are you doing?

831
33:48.840 --> 33:51.400
No, seeing Hu Sheng looking so frustrated,

832
33:51.440 --> 33:52.600
I really enjoyed it.

833
33:53.680 --> 33:56.040
Lawyer Li, that was a new trick today.

834
33:56.880 --> 33:58.920
Using their own force against them, right?

835
33:58.920 --> 33:59.960
I learned something.

836
33:59.960 --> 34:02.000
Your riding on my coattails wasn't bad either.

837
34:02.000 --> 34:03.200
There are still over forty minutes left.

838
34:03.200 --> 34:04.000
Forty-three.

839
34:04.640 --> 34:05.970
That really hit a nerve.

840
34:06.680 --> 34:08.080
I learned it all from you.

841
34:09.920 --> 34:11.120
No, what I meant was,

842
34:11.120 --> 34:12.120
didn't we also

843
34:12.120 --> 34:13.780
indirectly help Xiao Longnv?

844
34:14.000 --> 34:15.639
I really hope she wins this time.

845
34:15.639 --> 34:17.040
Xu Jiayi is so pitiful.

846
34:17.679 --> 34:18.480
Why don't you use this sympathy

847
34:18.480 --> 34:20.280
on Aunt Fang?

848
34:26.600 --> 34:27.199
Director.

849
34:27.800 --> 34:29.320
These are the successful precedents of similar cases

850
34:29.320 --> 34:31.280
I've collected over the past three years.

851
34:31.280 --> 34:32.080
Take a look.

852
34:32.880 --> 34:34.000
Sister, I've looked at them too.

853
34:34.000 --> 34:35.800
I think we have a great chance.

854
34:36.520 --> 34:37.600
I think

855
34:37.719 --> 34:38.840
we shouldn't just look at the successful ones,

856
34:38.840 --> 34:40.480
we should also look at the failed ones

857
34:40.480 --> 34:42.280
to manage our own expectations.

858
34:42.280 --> 34:43.960
What expectations?

859
34:43.960 --> 34:46.280
Jiayi is very determined about this.

860
34:46.280 --> 34:47.960
Can you stop being so pessimistic?

861
34:47.960 --> 34:48.960
Yeah, Uncle.

862
34:49.000 --> 34:50.639
Why are you pouring cold water on us?

863
34:50.639 --> 34:52.560
I'm just telling the truth.

864
34:52.560 --> 34:54.000
This case is hard to fight.

865
34:54.000 --> 34:54.880
Once it starts,

866
34:54.960 --> 34:56.120
if Hu Sheng records another video

867
34:56.120 --> 34:57.440
and talks nonsense on the internet,

868
34:57.440 --> 34:59.600
if he causes any more trouble,

869
34:59.640 --> 35:01.840
it will be even more hurtful to Xu Jiayi.

870
35:02.080 --> 35:02.800
Alright.

871
35:03.240 --> 35:04.240
Stop arguing.

872
35:04.760 --> 35:06.360
Regarding the second trial,

873
35:06.400 --> 35:07.840
let me arrange our strategy.

874
35:07.840 --> 35:09.320
There are two main tasks.

875
35:09.320 --> 35:12.400
First, we need to make the judge believe

876
35:12.400 --> 35:15.000
that this psychological trauma is real.

877
35:15.280 --> 35:16.480
Second,

878
35:16.600 --> 35:18.330
we need to make the judge accept

879
35:18.480 --> 35:21.920
that Jiayi's psychological trauma was caused by Hu Sheng.

880
35:23.080 --> 35:24.040
How do we make the judge accept it?

881
35:24.040 --> 35:25.400
Do I force the judge?

882
35:25.600 --> 35:27.330
What does it have to do with you?

883
35:27.600 --> 35:29.360
We need to hire a psychological expert

884
35:29.360 --> 35:32.400
to persuade the judge from a professional perspective.

885
35:32.400 --> 35:33.760
Okay, Director, I'll check right away.

886
35:33.760 --> 35:34.760
I'll go check too.

887
35:35.520 --> 35:36.760
Such an elite team.

888
35:41.240 --> 35:42.000
Sister Long.

889
35:42.160 --> 35:43.800
Hu Sheng deleted that video.

890
35:45.240 --> 35:46.160
Did he find his conscience?

891
35:46.160 --> 35:48.640
Come on, what conscience could he have?

892
35:50.240 --> 35:51.160
I know.

893
35:51.320 --> 35:53.920
It must be Lawyer Li representing the airline

894
35:53.920 --> 35:54.850
who stopped him.

895
35:55.480 --> 35:57.000
Good job, Lawyer Li.

896
36:13.680 --> 36:14.940
Wait a minute, you two.

897
36:15.040 --> 36:16.920
Why do you say he was the one who stopped it?

898
36:16.920 --> 36:19.560
Because Lawyer Li is better than you.

899
36:20.360 --> 36:21.760
And he's taller than you.

900
36:22.680 --> 36:25.520
Fine, my two colleagues. Rent goes up next month.

901
36:25.880 --> 36:27.680
Look at him, Sister Long.

902
36:30.600 --> 36:32.730
Lawyer Li, the video has been deleted.

903
36:34.160 --> 36:34.920
Got it.

904
36:35.480 --> 36:36.560
Let him show off.

905
36:38.160 --> 36:38.760
Lawyer Li.

906
36:39.920 --> 36:42.720
I don't think I've seen this smile of yours before.

907
36:43.160 --> 36:44.400
It's so sunny.

908
36:45.640 --> 36:46.120
Wasn't I

909
36:46.120 --> 36:46.960
sunny before?

910
36:58.560 --> 37:01.560
Many people don't understand acute stress reaction.

911
37:01.880 --> 37:04.740
It's actually the body's survival instinct switch

912
37:04.880 --> 37:06.480
when facing a sudden crisis.

913
37:06.960 --> 37:09.090
It can manifest as somatic reactions,

914
37:09.440 --> 37:10.560
nausea, vomiting,

915
37:10.680 --> 37:12.040
numbness in hands and feet,

916
37:12.040 --> 37:14.440
and alkalosis caused by hyperventilation.

917
37:14.440 --> 37:16.960
Some people even have dissociative symptoms.

918
37:16.960 --> 37:18.120
Sometimes, wounds of the mind

919
37:18.120 --> 37:19.050
I'm telling you,

920
37:19.320 --> 37:20.320
Director Zhuge

921
37:20.320 --> 37:23.080
is indeed the most authoritative psychological expert in the province.

922
37:23.080 --> 37:24.120
He speaks really well.

923
37:24.120 --> 37:27.040
can trigger overactivation of the brain's amygdala.

924
37:27.040 --> 37:28.560
Damaging nerve cells

925
37:28.720 --> 37:30.440
and causing chronic trauma.

926
37:34.360 --> 37:35.240
Dean Zhuge,

927
37:35.680 --> 37:37.280
I'm here to bother you again.

928
37:37.440 --> 37:38.560
That was a wonderful lecture.

929
37:38.560 --> 37:40.760
Class ended before I could hear enough.

930
37:41.360 --> 37:43.440
This is the person I mentioned on the phone,

931
37:43.440 --> 37:45.320
my old classmate, Lawyer Xiao Longnv.

932
37:45.320 --> 37:46.320
Hello, Dean.

933
37:46.320 --> 37:47.450
Hello, Xiao Longnv.

934
37:47.720 --> 37:48.560
Mr. Tian,

935
37:48.600 --> 37:50.000
I told you on the phone.

936
37:50.000 --> 37:52.240
I'm not interested in testifying in court.

937
37:52.240 --> 37:54.440
Do you want to hear about our case

938
37:54.440 --> 37:55.680
before you make a decision?

939
37:55.680 --> 37:57.920
I won't testify no matter what the case is.

940
37:57.920 --> 38:00.000
I just want to focus on my academic research.

941
38:00.000 --> 38:01.560
Don't worry. This case

942
38:01.560 --> 38:03.640
won't take up too much of your time and energy.

943
38:03.640 --> 38:04.960
Please reconsider.

944
38:05.440 --> 38:06.840
I really can't help you.

945
38:07.000 --> 38:09.560
We academics and you lawyers

946
38:09.560 --> 38:10.840
don't speak the same language.

947
38:10.840 --> 38:13.440
You'd better find someone else.

948
38:18.680 --> 38:19.320
Class monitor.

949
38:19.320 --> 38:20.720
Have some tea. Thank you.

950
38:24.320 --> 38:25.200
I'm sorry, Longnv.

951
38:25.200 --> 38:27.120
I couldn't be of much help to you.

952
38:29.200 --> 38:30.200
What did you call her?

953
38:30.200 --> 38:31.000
Longnv.

954
38:31.440 --> 38:33.200
Sounds like she has a physical defect.

955
38:33.200 --> 38:34.000
If you call her that,

956
38:34.000 --> 38:35.360
you have to call me Beihu.

957
38:35.360 --> 38:37.240
Of course, Beihu.

958
38:37.320 --> 38:39.450
Otherwise, should I call you Dongbei?

959
38:40.640 --> 38:42.370
You're so funny, Squad Leader.

960
38:42.520 --> 38:43.880
No, what are you doing?

961
38:43.880 --> 38:45.160
Acting like an idiot.

962
38:45.320 --> 38:46.720
No, I'm just trying to liven things up.

963
38:46.720 --> 38:48.480
Do we need you for that? Get out.

964
38:49.040 --> 38:50.100
Fine, I'll get out.

965
38:53.480 --> 38:54.440
I'm sorry.

966
38:54.440 --> 38:56.320
This kid is quite lively.

967
38:58.000 --> 38:59.720
Squad Leader, why

968
38:59.720 --> 39:01.980
is Director Zhuge unwilling to testify?

969
39:02.440 --> 39:03.720
Actually, Director Zhuge

970
39:03.720 --> 39:05.880
testified for me once a few years ago.

971
39:05.880 --> 39:06.880
But that time,

972
39:06.880 --> 39:08.320
the judge stated that psychotherapy

973
39:08.320 --> 39:10.160
is highly subjective,

974
39:10.160 --> 39:11.520
and ruled against us.

975
39:14.120 --> 39:15.760
So the old man cares a lot about his pride.

976
39:15.760 --> 39:17.120
If he won't do it, let's just find another expert.

977
39:17.120 --> 39:18.980
Is he the only one in the province?

978
39:19.720 --> 39:21.440
I'll just get out.

979
39:21.440 --> 39:22.170
Understood.

980
39:24.720 --> 39:25.560
You know what,

981
39:25.920 --> 39:28.440
he really is the only one authoritative enough.

982
39:28.440 --> 39:30.480
What if I write him a heartfelt letter

983
39:30.480 --> 39:32.540
to appeal to his emotions and reason?

984
39:32.880 --> 39:33.560
Sure.

985
39:34.000 --> 39:35.460
I'll talk to him again too.

986
39:35.720 --> 39:36.250
Hurry up.

987
39:39.520 --> 39:41.560
Do you two want to earn some credit?

988
39:44.000 --> 39:44.920
How?

989
39:51.400 --> 39:52.400
Is it this old man?

990
39:52.480 --> 39:53.140
Hello, sir.

991
39:53.240 --> 39:53.880
Hello.

992
39:54.720 --> 39:55.160
Yes.

993
39:55.800 --> 39:57.160
Come down and take a look.

994
39:57.160 --> 39:57.680
Hello.

995
39:58.320 --> 39:59.440
What are you doing?

996
39:59.800 --> 40:00.320
Where are you going?

997
40:00.320 --> 40:02.040
What are you doing? Are you going to hit him?

998
40:02.040 --> 40:04.080
Aren't we here to beg Professor Zhuge?

999
40:04.080 --> 40:05.880
How are you going to beg? Are you going to kneel down?

1000
40:05.880 --> 40:06.520
Okay.

1001
40:06.520 --> 40:07.720
What do you mean, okay?

1002
40:07.720 --> 40:09.640
You can't ask for a favor empty-handed.

1003
40:09.640 --> 40:10.440
Just keep an eye on him for now.

1004
40:10.440 --> 40:11.500
I have my own plans.

1005
40:13.680 --> 40:15.440
Act natural. Come on, get up.

1006
40:18.160 --> 40:19.090
Is this natural?

1007
40:32.520 --> 40:33.680
What kind of level is this?

1008
40:33.680 --> 40:35.140
I can't catch a single one.

1009
40:36.360 --> 40:37.220
How about this?

1010
40:37.440 --> 40:39.840
You two find a place nearby and buy two fish.

1011
40:41.320 --> 40:42.320
Why buy fish?

1012
40:42.680 --> 40:44.440
Just go when I tell you to. Don't ask.

1013
40:44.440 --> 40:46.800
This can't be reimbursed. You have to pay for it yourself.

1014
40:46.800 --> 40:48.120
Fine, I'll pay for it.

1015
40:48.200 --> 40:49.200
Then I'll have a chat with your Sister Long

1016
40:49.200 --> 40:50.960
about you still being in Honghu.

1017
40:50.960 --> 40:52.480
Why are you like this?

1018
40:52.480 --> 40:53.120
Fine.

1019
40:53.320 --> 40:54.180
Hurry up and go.

1020
40:54.880 --> 40:55.800
There won't be any fresh ones left soon.

1021
40:55.800 --> 40:56.800
Hurry, hurry up.

1022
40:57.840 --> 40:58.640
Let's go.

1023
41:08.360 --> 41:09.640
Sir, I've been watching you all morning.

1024
41:09.640 --> 41:10.920
You haven't caught much.

1025
41:10.920 --> 41:13.000
There are just fewer fish this season.

1026
41:13.000 --> 41:15.200
What season? Are the fish hibernating?

1027
41:15.560 --> 41:17.360
You just picked the wrong spot.

1028
41:17.920 --> 41:19.120
I was just over there.

1029
41:19.360 --> 41:20.480
There were so many fish.

1030
41:20.480 --> 41:21.520
You don't even need to fish.

1031
41:21.520 --> 41:23.440
They were just jumping onto the shore.

1032
41:23.440 --> 41:24.920
Why don't you go fish over there?

1033
41:24.920 --> 41:25.760
You mean over there?

1034
41:25.760 --> 41:26.480
Yeah.

1035
41:26.640 --> 41:28.240
Come on, I'll take you there.

1036
41:28.400 --> 41:30.000
Come on, pack up your things.

1037
41:32.240 --> 41:32.720
I'll give it a try.

1038
41:32.720 --> 41:33.280
Yeah.

1039
41:39.240 --> 41:39.840
Bought it.

1040
41:40.280 --> 41:41.000
No problem.

1041
42:03.680 --> 42:05.040
Here it comes.

1042
42:05.080 --> 42:05.880
Got it. It took the bait.

1043
42:05.880 --> 42:07.000
Come, let me net it.

1044
42:07.000 --> 42:07.280
Don't rush.

1045
42:07.280 --> 42:08.600
Tire it out.

1046
42:08.640 --> 42:09.170
Alright.

1047
42:09.400 --> 42:10.360
Here it comes.

1048
42:10.360 --> 42:12.090
It's really big. Here it comes.

1049
42:13.160 --> 42:15.020
Your skills are really good, sir.

1050
42:15.720 --> 42:17.000
It's such a big one.

1051
42:17.080 --> 42:18.080
He's really good at this, right?

1052
42:18.080 --> 42:19.400
You guys are amazing.

1053
42:19.520 --> 42:20.120
Young man.

1054
42:20.520 --> 42:21.400
You're really something.

1055
42:21.400 --> 42:23.000
Just average. Very average.

1056
42:24.080 --> 42:25.280
How can it be average?

1057
42:26.040 --> 42:28.570
It's my first time catching a koi in the river.

1058
42:33.320 --> 42:34.720
Your first time?

1059
42:35.560 --> 42:37.360
I catch koi all the time.

1060
42:37.680 --> 42:39.080
Isn't there a saying?

1061
42:39.080 --> 42:40.080
It goes like this.

1062
42:40.600 --> 42:43.480
When koi arrives, great wealth and good luck naturally follow.

1063
42:43.480 --> 42:43.880
Right?

1064
42:44.800 --> 42:45.960
This young man really knows how to talk.

1065
42:45.960 --> 42:47.680
The God of Wealth is here. The God of Wealth is here.

1066
42:47.680 --> 42:49.320
Good deeds get good rewards.

1067
42:49.320 --> 42:51.240
The God of Wealth says to make money the right way.

1068
42:51.240 --> 42:52.240
Okay, okay, okay.

1069
42:52.600 --> 42:53.400
Stop acting.

1070
42:53.880 --> 42:56.680
You're from Lawyer Xiao's law firm, right?
